#: /home/user/metascrub/ubuntu-touch/metascrub/qml/AboutPage.qml:16
msgid "About metascrub"
msgstr ""

#: /home/user/metascrub/ubuntu-touch/metascrub/qml/AboutPage.qml:20
#: /home/user/metascrub/ubuntu-touch/metascrub/qml/ExportPage.qml:24
#: /home/user/metascrub/ubuntu-touch/metascrub/qml/HandbookPage.qml:25
#: /home/user/metascrub/ubuntu-touch/metascrub/qml/ImportPage.qml:26
msgid "Back"
msgstr ""

#: /home/user/metascrub/ubuntu-touch/metascrub/qml/AboutPage.qml:64
msgid ""
"metascrub removes the hidden data a file carries about you — where a photo "
"was taken, which camera and account made a document, its editing history — "
"and tells you honestly how much it could remove."
msgstr ""

#: /home/user/metascrub/ubuntu-touch/metascrub/qml/AboutPage.qml:71
msgid "What it will not do"
msgstr ""

#: /home/user/metascrub/ubuntu-touch/metascrub/qml/AboutPage.qml:82
msgid ""
"Every file is cleaned on this phone. Nothing is uploaded, and the app keeps "
"no accounts. It never shows a result it has not earned: a file it cannot "
"fully take apart is marked so, never presented as clean."
msgstr ""

#: /home/user/metascrub/ubuntu-touch/metascrub/qml/AboutPage.qml:90
msgid "You do not have to take our word for it"
msgstr ""

#: /home/user/metascrub/ubuntu-touch/metascrub/qml/AboutPage.qml:101
msgid ""
"On Ubuntu Touch every app runs under an AppArmor profile that lists what it "
"is allowed to touch. metascrub asks for two things: to receive files from "
"other apps, and to give files back. It does not ask for network access, so "
"the system itself refuses to let it reach one. The profile is a short file "
"inside the app package (metascrub.apparmor) and anyone can read it."
msgstr ""

#: /home/user/metascrub/ubuntu-touch/metascrub/qml/AboutPage.qml:111
msgid "What it cannot promise"
msgstr ""

#: /home/user/metascrub/ubuntu-touch/metascrub/qml/AboutPage.qml:122
msgid ""
"Files handed to metascrub, and the cleaned copies it writes, sit in this "
"app's own storage until you clear them. Clearing deletes them the ordinary "
"way: on flash storage the data may survive until those blocks are reused, "
"and no application can change that. Nothing here protects you from a phone "
"that has already been tampered with."
msgstr ""

#: /home/user/metascrub/ubuntu-touch/metascrub/qml/AboutPage.qml:131
msgid "Source"
msgstr ""

#: /home/user/metascrub/ubuntu-touch/metascrub/qml/AboutPage.qml:142
msgid ""
"Free software, GPL-3.0. The same audited core runs on the desktop, on "
"Android and on Sailfish OS.\n"
"github.com/NoxToxCipher/metascrub"
msgstr ""

